Oops — I wrote a weird `copy()` in StreamState (leftover from an experiment). Let me fix it to a proper copy constructor. Also the `final` ByteStore field needs to be shared.

Let me rewrite StreamState:

```java
private static final class StreamState {
    long high;
    Long fin;
    Long reset;
    Long stop;
    long sendMax;
    final ByteStore bytes;

    StreamState() { this.bytes = new ByteStore(); }
    private StreamState(ByteStore bytes) { this.bytes = bytes; }

    StreamState copy() {
        StreamState c = new StreamState(bytes);
        c.high = high; c.fin = fin; c.reset = reset; c.stop = stop; c.sendMax = sendMax;
        return c;
    }
}
```

